import{_ as n,o as a,c as i,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 730 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | The Hang-Up Essence of Shrouding the Heavens' Ye Fan as Mortal-World Immortal","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 730 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | The Hang-Up Essence of Shrouding the Heavens' Ye Fan as Mortal-World Immortal","no":730,"module":4,"tags":["Critique of Hang-Up Retirement","Shrouding the Heavens","Ye Fan","Mortal-World Immortal","Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards","90-Glossary"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0730_模块4-遮天叶凡红尘仙的挂机本质.md","filePath":"en/0730_模块4-遮天叶凡红尘仙的挂机本质.md"}`),o={name:"en/0730_模块4-遮天叶凡红尘仙的挂机本质.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,d){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-730-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-the-hang-up-essence-of-shrouding-the-heavens-ye-fan-as-mortal-world-immortal" tabindex="-1">Entry 730 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | The Hang-Up Essence of Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Ye Fan as Mortal-World Immortal <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-730-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-the-hang-up-essence-of-shrouding-the-heavens-ye-fan-as-mortal-world-immortal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 730 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | The Hang-Up Essence of Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Ye Fan as Mortal-World Immortal&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 90</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-what-the-nine-dragon-coffin-pulled-out-is-a-hang-up-endpoint" tabindex="-1">Introduction: what the nine-dragon coffin pulled out is a hang-up endpoint <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-what-the-nine-dragon-coffin-pulled-out-is-a-hang-up-endpoint" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: what the nine-dragon coffin pulled out is a hang-up endpoint&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shrouding the Heavens&#39; ending is a classic sample of the web-novel hang-up-retirement paradigm. Ye Fan&#39;s journey — from Earth to Big Dipper, from mortal to Mortal-World Immortal, ultimately becoming the cosmos&#39;s topmost being. But Heng Yuan Zhou Library must measure with the ruler built in the previous 29 entries: <strong>on Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ledger, what is Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;Mortal-World Immortal&quot;?</strong> The answer: a hang-up sample under &quot;medium&quot; protagonist-uniqueness dependency — he is strong, but he does not lift people; he lives, but he does not work; he wins, but his civilization did not become better because of his win.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry act as the critique ruler: the anti-predation axiom examines Ye Fan&#39;s power source; the republican axiom of Myriad Races asks whether his manuals were made public; the collective ascension axiom judges whether he carries Myriad Ranks; the causal self-discipline axiom examines his cross-plane operations; the law-first axiom examines Shrouding the Heavens&#39; setting self-consistency.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-heng-yuan-zhou-s-judgment-of-ye-fan-s-mortal-world-immortal" tabindex="-1">I. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Judgment of Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;Mortal-World Immortal&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-heng-yuan-zhou-s-judgment-of-ye-fan-s-mortal-world-immortal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Judgment of Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;Mortal-World Immortal&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment standards, Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;Mortal-World Immortal&quot; realm has three problems:</p><h3 id="_1-1-power-source-not-clean" tabindex="-1">1.1 Power Source Not Clean <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-power-source-not-clean" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Power Source Not Clean&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Ye Fan&#39;s rise accompanies massive combat, devouring, and treasure-seizing. His power did not come through the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s lawful channels, but grew in predatory fashion through life-and-death battles. Per Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s source audit, his energy purity cannot reach 99%; he carries predatory residual traces.</p><h3 id="_1-2-endpoint-is-the-endpoint" tabindex="-1">1.2 Endpoint Is the Endpoint <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-endpoint-is-the-endpoint" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Endpoint Is the Endpoint&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Mortal-World Immortal is Shrouding the Heavens&#39; top realm. After Ye Fan reaches Mortal-World Immortal, the story ends. He has no next step — no post, no nine-post rotation, no perpetual construction. His &quot;transcendence&quot; is a period.</p><h3 id="_1-3-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-medium" tabindex="-1">1.3 Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency &quot;Medium&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-medium" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency &quot;Medium&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Per Glossary Article 50, Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Ye Fan&#39;s protagonist-uniqueness dependency rating is &quot;medium&quot; (oligarchic). His civilization revolves around him, but he is not an extreme oligarch of Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;everything belongs to me&quot; kind; he has companions, disciples, and a cosmos. But he is still an oligarch — civilization&#39;s highest decision-making power rests in his hands alone.</p><h2 id="ii-ye-fan-s-hang-up-essence-concrete-manifestations-of-the-four-symptoms" tabindex="-1">II. Ye Fan&#39;s Hang-Up Essence: Concrete Manifestations of the Four Symptoms <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-ye-fan-s-hang-up-essence-concrete-manifestations-of-the-four-symptoms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Ye Fan&#39;s Hang-Up Essence: Concrete Manifestations of the Four Symptoms&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-myriad-ranks-stay-where-they-are" tabindex="-1">2.1 Myriad Ranks Stay Where They Are <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-myriad-ranks-stay-where-they-are" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Myriad Ranks Stay Where They Are&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After Ye Fan ascends, the cosmos behind him keeps running, but no longer uplifts because of him. Later generations only need to look up at the Mortal-World Immortal; no need to catch up. This is the &quot;ceiling for later generations&quot; discussed in Entry 729 — Ye Fan himself is the ceiling.</p><h3 id="_2-2-knowledge-privatized" tabindex="-1">2.2 Knowledge Privatized <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-knowledge-privatized" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Knowledge Privatized&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Ye Fan&#39;s manuals, his understanding of the Great Dao, his lifelong experience never entered a public &quot;Selfless-Dao public library.&quot; They only circulate within his bloodline, his sect, his small circle. Ordinary beings among billions never read a single note of his experience in a lifetime.</p><h3 id="_2-3-cross-plane-operations-not-reported" tabindex="-1">2.3 Cross-Plane Operations Not Reported <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-cross-plane-operations-not-reported" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Cross-Plane Operations Not Reported&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Ye Fan&#39;s cross-cosmos travel, his historical intervention, his time-river operations all fail under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom. He does not report, does not audit, does not accept multi-layer supervision — he is his own rule.</p><h3 id="_2-4-lonely-invincibility" tabindex="-1">2.4 Lonely Invincibility <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-4-lonely-invincibility" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.4 Lonely Invincibility&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The romantic feeling of Shrouding the Heavens&#39; ending is essentially lonely invincibility. Ye Fan stands at the highest point; old friends have passed, peers have withered, later generations look up. This loneliness is taken by readers as &quot;a strong one&#39;s medal&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou judges it as &quot;hang-up retirement&quot; — <strong>he is not symbiotic with Myriad Ranks; he stands above Myriad Ranks.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-what-happens-if-ye-fan-enters-heng-yuan-zhou" tabindex="-1">III. What Happens If Ye Fan Enters Heng Yuan Zhou <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-what-happens-if-ye-fan-enters-heng-yuan-zhou" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. What Happens If Ye Fan Enters Heng Yuan Zhou&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny Ye Fan&#39;s power. If Ye Fan were placed into Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s system:</p><ul><li>His destructive-power score would be extremely high;</li><li>But his civilizational consensus degree would be pulled low at the source-audit stage;</li><li>He could not pass the nine posts&#39; ethical review;</li><li>He would be classified as a &quot;high-risk individual,&quot; not a &quot;transcended one.&quot;</li></ul><p>It is not that he is not strong enough, but that his strength is incompatible with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law definition. <strong>His strength is predatory strength; his transcendence is hang-up transcendence.</strong> This is not a negation of the character Ye Fan; this is a critique of the paradigm he sits in.</p><h2 id="iv-shrouding-the-heavens-book-eating-ending-risk" tabindex="-1">IV. Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Book-Eating/Ending-Risk <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-shrouding-the-heavens-book-eating-ending-risk" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Book-Eating/Ending-Risk&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Module 2&#39;s evaluation dimensions, Shrouding the Heavens&#39; book-eating/ending-risk rating is &quot;medium-high&quot;:</p><ul><li>The realm system set in the early period is constantly broken through and added to in the later period;</li><li>The combat-power ruler floats with the protagonist&#39;s needs;</li><li>Some foreshadowing in the ending is not fully recovered;</li><li>Protagonist-uniqueness dependency is &quot;medium&quot;; civilization is deeply tied to Ye Fan personally.</li></ul><p>Under the law-first axiom, Shrouding the Heavens&#39; setting self-consistency cannot approach full marks. This is not disparagement; it is structural inevitability.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s Mortal-World Immortal computable power stops producing after reaching the summit; this is civilization-grade waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s power source has predatory residual traces; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s source audit does not pass</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s protagonist-uniqueness dependency is &quot;medium,&quot; higher than Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;extremely low,&quot; lower than Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;extreme&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s manuals only circulate in a small circle; 99% of clans cannot read his experience</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s law understanding never entered the Selfless-Dao public library; hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge was privately taken away</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s Mortal-World Immortal is a strong-one romance under the Shrouding paradigm; it is a hang-up sample under the Heng Yuan Zhou paradigm. He is strong, he wins, he is immortal, but his strength did not convert into Myriad Ranks&#39; uplift speed; his win did not convert into public knowledge; his immortality did not convert into sustained post work. <strong>This is not Ye Fan&#39;s personal fault; this is the Shrouding paradigm&#39;s disease — and what Heng Yuan Zhou Library must do is cure this disease at the law level.</strong></p><p>In the end, the hang-up essence of Shrouding the Heavens&#39; Ye Fan as Mortal-World Immortal described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energetic traces are throughout filed in the Alaya Network, traceable and correctable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/90-术语词典.html">Entry 90 · Glossary</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/729-挂机养老批判总论.html">Entry 729 · Critique of Hang-Up Retirement Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',38)])])}const g=n(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
